    <!-- =========================================================================
         SEAT CARD — one seal's slot on the Blubberball team select.
         Every word is bound, so uiText.csv and rosterCast.js keep owning the
         copy; the literals here are lorem and are only what shows before the
         game pushes anything in.

         Hover lifts the ground and lights a FEATHERED STROKE. The feather has
         to be on a stroke: inside a Fill it renders nothing at all, with a
         clean build and an empty problems list.
         ========================================================================= -->
